  "description": "After being framed for plagiarism, Hyedo flees to a new city to start over as an art teacher. Just as he’s settling into his new life, he discovers Myeongwol Bathhouse and its stunningly handsome owner, Yoonje. Now, not only is Yoonje completely Hyedo’s type, but the man is incredibly forward with Hyedo. So it’s pretty inevitable that Hyedo falls for the man’s charms and into his bed during one drunken night. But is a happy ending also inevitable for the two of them? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
